  isAutomatic: 0
  ChangeTimeOfAction: 0
  Text: "He saw nothing. He just heard it. \n \n\r\"I'd never leave the counter alone!
    My boss would kill me!\" \r\n\n\u201CFirst there was like this weird mooing,
    I really thought to myself that's some <link>special cow</link> out there, but
    then there was this loud screech, and <link>something BIG</link> like mostly
    big crashed. Then I don't know what I heard... It sounded like... like too much
    all together, like a slow explosion. Then it got quiet. Then <link>it got on
    the roof</link>.\"  \n \n\"You know whats going on, sir. \nSo...How screwed are
    we?\" "
  TextForRepetition: 'We already did that, remember?

    The report is probably
    on your desk, or in the DB if you uploaded it.'
